msgstr "发布为 `einarolafsson/toxoplasma-from-hoechst-cpsam <https://huggingface.co/einarolafsson/toxoplasma-from-hoechst-cpsam>`_，名称为 ``toxoplasma_from_hoechst_pv``。"

